'''George Larry Jameson''' (born February 1, 1953) is a former [[National Football League]] (NFL) [[defensive tackle]] who played for the [[Tampa Bay Buccaneers]] in 1976. He attended Rantoul High School and then [[Indiana University]] before being taken in the 6th round, 152nd overall, by the [[St. Louis Cardinals (football)|St. Louis Cardinals]] in the [[1975 NFL draft]].<ref>{{usurped|1=[https://web.archive.org/web/20131001080013/http://databasefootball.com/players/playerpage.htm?ilkid=JAMESLAR01 DatabaseFootball.com]}}</ref>
